      "id": "move-units-step"
    },
    "summary": "Some rules make you pick a mode, as **fall-back moves** do:\n\n- Modes exclude each other, and you check them in the order printed.\n- A unit that meets the conditions of none of a move’s modes can’t make that move.\n- A mode may be mandatory when it applies, such as consolidation modes, but a Fall Back move’s **ordered retreat** is optional, so you may pick **desperate escape** instead.\n- A move type’s during- or after-move conditions marked with a mode name apply only if that mode was picked; unmarked ones always apply.",
